                                                "sense_id": "35556ac9-d6c5-3b0c-92d4-c87e46e27732",
                                                "text": "In my cool room with the shutters shut and the thin shives of air and light coming through the slats, I cried myself to sleep in an overloud selfpitying transport."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eaa5ef1f-da54-3168-8b77-872817837f13",
