                                                "sense_id": "86dad712-3858-322c-8ecb-5749681163a1",
                                                "text": "If the conditioning continues to be fairly brisk, a wooden tut might appear to distort a little under the stress of the internal pressure, with the beer seeping out around the tut and shive."
